    "디바인 수녀님이 내가 말해야 할 모든 것을 듣고 아버지에 대해, 마르쿠스에 대해... 정찰대 시절과 다른 많은 것들에 대해 많은 질문을 했다."

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:531
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_6dca8951:

    # "It was strange, for all her vixen ways, she was surprisingly sweet and tender when she let down her guard, and when I spoke, she really did listen... {i}and care.{/i}"
    "이상하게도, 그녀의 모든 요부 같은 방식에도 불구하고, 경계를 풀면 놀랍도록 다정하고 부드러웠고, 내가 말할 때 그녀는 정말로 들었고... {i}신경 썼다.{/i}"

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:532
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_e58ed81f:

    # DIVINE "...That must have all been very difficult for you."
    DIVINE "\"...그건 모두 당신에게 아주 힘들었겠군요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:533
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_3246cb2d:

    # DIVINE "Seeing your friends die."
    DIVINE "\"친구들이 죽는 걸 보는 것.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:534
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_f8d1acbc:

    # MC "...Yes."
    MC "\"...네.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:535
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_e6b5f8dc:

    # MC "...But what about you?"
    MC "\"...하지만 당신은요?\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:536
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_b2e8c04f:

    # DIVINE "{i}Me?{/i}"
    DIVINE "\"{i}나요?{/i}\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:537
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_e0c51a2c:

    # MC "Well yeah, you’ve got a story too, right?"
    MC "\"음 그래요, 당신도 이야기가 있잖아요, 그렇죠?\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:538
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_75dadf4c:

    # "Sister Divine became slightly uncomfortable,"
    "디바인 수녀님이 살짝 불편해졌다,"

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:539
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_966d6a1a:

    # DIVINE "...Being a mage of Palam is... {i}difficult.{/i}"
    DIVINE "\"...팔람의 마법사가 되는 건... {i}어려워요.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:540
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_f7ec337b:

    # DIVINE "Many of the expectations and hopes your family had with you cease overnight, you belong to Palam now... and you will likely be raised in one of the towers regardless of what they think."
    DIVINE "\"가족이 가졌던 많은 기대와 희망이 하룻밤 사이에 사라지고, 당신은 이제 팔람에 속해요... 그리고 그들이 뭘 생각하든 탑 중 하나에서 자라날 거예요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:541
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_a9a95b77:

    # DIVINE "Your path is already set."
    DIVINE "\"당신의 길은 이미 정해져 있어요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:542
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC "..."

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:543
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_8e9e786f:

    # DIVINE "Many families see it as a sign of blessing when it's a third or fourth child."
    DIVINE "\"많은 가정에서 셋째나 넷째 아이일 때 축복의 신호로 봐요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:544
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_68c4dc0f:

    # DIVINE "But... My father and mother were desperate to have even one, fearing one of them might be infertile."
    DIVINE "\"하지만... 아버지와 어머니는 둘 중 하나가 불임일까 두려워 단 하나라도 가지려고 필사적이었어요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:545
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_76910f7d:

    # DIVINE "When my mother was pregnant, they were ecstatic... believing one of the gods had answered their prayers for a son."
    DIVINE "\"어머니가 임신했을 때, 그들은 환희에 찼어요... 신이 아들을 위한 기도에 응답해줬다고 믿었죠.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:546
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_17a2d777:

    # DIVINE "...Till they saw my blue skin."
    DIVINE "\"...내 파란 피부를 보기 전까지는요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:547
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_f5452fc6:

    # DIVINE "And just like that, they knew that their {i}only{/i} child they’d ever have, they’d never get to raise."
    DIVINE "\"그리고 그렇게, 그들은 자신들이 가질 {i}유일한{/i} 자식을 결코 키울 수 없을 거란 걸 알았어요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:548
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_59160b34:

    # MC "But they must have stayed in touch?"
    MC "\"하지만 계속 연락했겠죠?\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:549
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_3ae4e4cf:

    # DIVINE "...No, they chose not to."
    DIVINE "\"...아니요, 그러지 않기로 선택했어요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:550
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_b4b40dd7:

    # MC "But... Why?"
    MC "\"하지만... 왜요?\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:551
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_b5e97853:

    # DIVINE "I believe it was too painful for them."
    DIVINE "\"그들에게는 너무 고통스러웠을 거예요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:552
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_bd0283f7:

    # DIVINE "A son or daughter they could have tolerated."
    DIVINE "\"아들이나 딸은 참을 수 있었을 거예요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:553
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_8010b558:

    # DIVINE "But me? A thing which would only pass in and out of their lives as a visitor?"
    DIVINE "\"하지만 나요? 그들의 삶에 방문객으로만 들락거리게 될 존재?\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:554
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_b966f0e8:

    # DIVINE "Well, they didn’t want to be reminded of their..."
    DIVINE "\"음, 그들은 자신들의... 상기되길 원하지 않았어요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:555
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_453e56a1:

    # "The words came painfully to Sister Divine,"
    "그 말이 디바인 수녀님에게 고통스럽게 다가왔다,"

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:556
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_c5ae26aa:

    # DIVINE "{i}Failure...{/i}"
    DIVINE "\"{i}실패...{/i}\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:557
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_3dfd34a6:

    # MC "Could you not have visited them?"
    MC "\"그들을 방문할 수 없었나요?\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:558
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_b0fad82f:

    # DIVINE "It's possible for some if they're born in Novaras itself, but for many, the distance to their villages and towns is too far a journey."
    DIVINE "\"노바라스 자체에서 태어난 일부에게는 가능하지만, 많은 이들에게는 마을과 도시까지의 거리가 너무 먼 여정이에요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:559
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_7a5bb1c1:

    # DIVINE "And Mages, especially young ones, rarely have much free time to themselves."
    DIVINE "\"그리고 마법사들, 특히 어린 이들은 자신을 위한 자유 시간이 거의 없어요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:560
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_989203d6:

    # DIVINE "It's not uncommon for mages to not see their families for years at a time... Hence why some find it too painful and would rather just cut ties."
    DIVINE "\"마법사들이 몇 년씩 가족을 못 보는 것은 드문 일이 아니에요... 그래서 어떤 이들은 너무 고통스러워서 차라리 인연을 끊어버리죠.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:561
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_db291d5f:

    # MC "...That’s horrible."
    MC "\"...그건 끔찍하네요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:562
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_68249a6b:

    # DIVINE "It’s fine, my parents died a long time ago."
    DIVINE "\"괜찮아요, 부모님은 오래전에 돌아가셨어요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:563
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_b67c7047:

    # "Sister Divine forced a smile."
    "디바인 수녀님이 억지로 미소 지었다."

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:564
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_9b735b30:

    # DIVINE "My family is here now."
    DIVINE "\"내 가족은 이제 여기 있어요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:565
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_a6953dc2:

    # DIVINE "But... I’d rather not talk much more about my past now, if that’s okay."
    DIVINE "\"하지만... 괜찮다면, 내 과거에 대해 더 이상 많이 이야기하고 싶지 않아요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:566
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_9e3c157a:

    # "With my hand gently caressing her face, I smiled."
    "내 손이 부드럽게 그녀의 얼굴을 쓰다듬으며, 나는 미소 지었다."

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:567
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_1967aa2a:

    # MC "{i}I don't believe you’re a failure.{/i}"
    MC "\"내 생각에 당신은 실패작이 아니에요.\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:568
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_8c367fa6:

    # DIVINE "I-"
    DIVINE "\"나-\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:569
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_4370204d:

    # DIVINE "...{i}Thank you.{/i}"
    DIVINE "\"...{i}고마워요.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:570
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_1d79eac1:

    # "Sister Divine's eyes became glossy as she nestled her face into my chest timidly... drifting off comfortably to sleep."
    "디바인 수녀님의 눈이 반짝이며 소심하게 내 가슴에 얼굴을 파묻고... 편안히 잠에 빠져들었다."

# game/data/world_romance/divine/scr_firstEncounter.rpy:581
translate kr rom_divine_firsttime_cuddles_9adeacbe:

